//RS //! Unified dependency-aware watch / invalidation / hot-replacement engine
//RS //! (Tower #439 / E3-UL6).
//RS //!
//RS //! One typed graph feeds `jet run --watch` and `jet dev`. Nodes carry a
//RS //! `RootKind`; reverse edges give exact closure invalidation. Receipts are
//RS //! deterministic. `#Persist` migration and client/server replacement commit
//RS //! as one transaction or leave the prior session valid.
//RS 
